 "name_en": "Sales Quotation (BDG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Quotation (BDG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item starts when requests for quotations are received from customers. Quotations are created in the system and can be either accepted or rejected by customers.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create quotation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send quotation to customer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Assure your business partners that you will deliver a certain product configuration and quantity at a specific time and price</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">During sales order processing, sales employees can use a variety of sales functions and special quotation functions</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>销售报价 (BDG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目在收到客户的报价请求后开始。报价在系统中创建，可由客户接受或拒绝。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建报价</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将报价发送给客户</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2aa9303907c74470a2a28856e10eb01e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">确保您的业务伙伴将在特定时间和价格交付特定产品配置和数量。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在销售订单处理期间，销售员工可以使用各种销售功能和特殊报价功能</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
